---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import InstallCommand from '../components/InstallCommand.astro';
import GateExample from '../components/GateExample.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../lib/paths';
---
<SiteLayout title="Good code. No slop." active="">
<section>
<div class="eyebrow">Independent software tools / Analogue Rebellion ’83</div>
<div class="hero">
<h1>Good code.<br>
<span class="red">No slop.</span>
</h1>
<img class="stamp" src={sitePath("art/stamp.svg")} alt="Zero npm dependencies">
</div>
<img class="stripe" src={sitePath("art/stripes.svg")} alt="">
<p>
<strong>Your AI coding agent needs standards. Not another strongly worded prompt.</strong>
</p>
<p>Agent skills and deterministic checks for reuse, composition and modular code. Built for React and Node projects.</p>
<InstallCommand />
<p class="tag">Node ≥18 / Git / Zero npm dependencies</p>
<div class="actions">
<a class="btn btn-outline" href={sitePath("manual/")} >Read the manual →</a>
<a href={sitePath("kits/")} >Browse the kits →</a>
</div>
<GateExample />
</section>
<section>
<div class="eyebrow">FIG. 01 / How it works</div>
<h2>Three lines of defence.</h2>
<div class="three">
<article class="rule">
<p class="tag">01 / WRITE</p>
<h3>Reuse first.</h3>
<p>Skills and a generated component index guide agents before they create files.</p>
</article>
<article class="rule">
<p class="tag">02 / COMMIT</p>
<h3>Catch it early.</h3>
<p>Staged modularity and documentation checks fail on violations.</p>
</article>
<article class="rule">
<p class="tag">03 / PUSH</p>
<h3>Hold the line.</h3>
<p>Full-tree gates and project checks. CI provides another independent layer.</p>
</article>
</div>
<a href={sitePath("gates/")} >Explore the gates →</a>
</section>
<section>
<div class="evidence">
<p class="tag">Field test 001 / README-reported results</p>
<h2>Less slop. Measurably.</h2>
<div class="three">
<div>Logic duplication <span class="number">17.4 → 0%</span>
</div>
<div>Undocumented exports <span class="number">89 → 0</span>
</div>
<div>Oversized pages <span class="number">4 → 0</span>
</div>
</div>
<p>Next.js 16 / Payload 3 care-records system; 78 integration tests. One project, not a universal benchmark.</p>
<a href="https://github.com/hyperbolictonic/opencode-anti-slop#proven-on-a-real-codebase">Read the evidence ↗</a>
</div>
</section>
</SiteLayout>
